/*Looping statement:
1) While statement
2) Do....while statement
3) For statement

1) While statement:
	If we want to run a set of statements repeatly we use while statement.
	"Entry Controlled Loop"
Syntax:

	while(condition)
	{
	  staements;
	}
*/
//Example:
